# /etc/pft-peertls.waivers (root-owned, private). CHECK TARGET|* until=YYYY-MM-DD reason
# Only for a finding that cannot be fixed on the host; report it privately. --public reports drop the finding and
# the probes behind it and keep only the count. Expired waivers stop applying and are counted in the report.
# hs.ems * until=2026-12-31 example only: build without EMS, no config key, reported privately
